(text "Q921 D->VIN, S->A. Q922 S1/S2/S3->A, D5->protected buck VIN. RTN PAD13 FLOAT." (at 30 37 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "d0c01474-8000-4000-9000-000000000203"))
(text "ACC START upstream: 01H Q915 emitter receives LM748_VS_SAFE, not switched VOUT. BUCK_ENABLE controls U921 EN/UVLO and U101 buck EN." (at 30 120 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "d0c01474-8000-4000-9000-000000000204"))
(text "OV: VSNS->VS (<=70V), SW->R922->R923->OV->R924->GND. Nominal OV about 36.3V; temperature/leakage not validated." (at 30 136 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "d0c01474-8000-4000-9000-000000000205"))
(text "EXTERNAL vehicle BAT/ACC fuses required. LM74800 is NOT an eFuse: short circuit / FET SOA / ISO surge remain OPEN." (at 30 390 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "d0c01474-8000-4000-9000-000000000206"))
(text "TI EVM CS C10=15nF on RTN PAD13 to AGND conflicts with datasheet RTN FLOAT; OMIT pending TI clarification. C924=1uF on A to GND." (at 30 372 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "d0c01474-8000-4000-9000-000000000207"))
(text "R921 200V/350ms pulse >= 0.7J and VS zener thermal NOT QUALIFIED. NEVER ORDER / USE IN VEHICLE." (at 30 406 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "d0c01474-8000-4000-9000-000000000208"))
